{"id":"schnee","lemma":"Schnee","pos":"noun","rank":1787,"glosses":["snow","snow (static on TV set etc.)","cocaine"],"ipa":"/ʃneː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/De-Schnee.ogg/De-Schnee.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Schnees"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich mag Schnee.","en":"I like snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394307","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},null]},{"text":"Ist das Schnee?","en":"Is that snow?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Der Schnee wird bald verschwinden.","en":"The snow will soon disappear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593012","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"to disappear"}]},{"text":"Wegen des Schnees konnte man kaum sehen.","en":"You could hardly see because of the snow.","words":[{"g":"for, because of"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"barely, hardly"},{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Im Schnee sind frische Spuren.","en":"There are fresh tracks in the snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718190","words":[{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"freshly","l":"frisch"},{"g":"to leave a trace"}]}]}